# GPU power-iteration resume checkpoints: scratch state, can exceed GitHub's
# 100 MB limit (the (16,5) vector alone is 1.8 GB). Keep local only; the JSON
# artifacts carry all results. Two small pre-existing checkpoints remain
# tracked from before this rule.
